### REST client file (VS Code "REST Client" / IntelliJ HTTP client). Local stack: scripts/run-local.sh
### Variables - set them in your environment file or edit here. The password is the SYNTHETIC LOCAL_DEMO_PASSWORD you chose.
@api = http://localhost:18480/api/v1
@password = {{$processEnv LOCAL_DEMO_PASSWORD}}

### 1. Sign in as an operator (local profile token issuer)
# @name loginOps
POST {{api}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "omar.ops", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@opsToken = {{loginOps.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Sign in as a customer
# @name loginAlice
POST {{api}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice.customer", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@aliceToken = {{loginAlice.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Who am I?
GET {{api}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 4. My accounts (customers only ever see their own)
GET {{api}}/accounts?size=20&sort=openedAt,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 5. Balance of a seeded account
GET {{api}}/accounts/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 6. Deposit (202 Accepted; Idempotency-Key is mandatory - repeat this request to see Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{api}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Idempotency-Key: http-file-deposit-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "DEPOSIT", "targetAccountId": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "amount": "25.00", "currency": "USD", "memo": "REST client deposit" }

### 7. Withdrawal that exceeds the balance (422 TRANSACTION_REJECTED, INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS)
POST {{api}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Idempotency-Key: http-file-withdraw-0002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "WITHDRAWAL", "sourceAccountId": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "amount": "9999999.00", "currency": "USD" }

### 8. Transfer between two of Alice's accounts
POST {{api}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Idempotency-Key: http-file-transfer-0003
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "TRANSFER", "sourceAccountId": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "targetAccountId": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003", "amount": "10.00", "currency": "USD" }

### 9. Search transactions (filters, paging, sorting)
GET {{api}}/transactions?status=COMPLETED&type=DEPOSIT&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 10. BOLA check: Alice asks for Bob's account -> 404 (and an ACCESS_DENIED audit event)
GET {{api}}/accounts/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 11. Operations dashboard
GET {{api}}/ops/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### 12. Platform health (database, clearing network, outbox, reconciliation)
GET {{api}}/ops/health
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### 13. Open reconciliation records
GET {{api}}/ops/reconciliations?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### 14. Audit events
GET {{api}}/ops/audit-events?size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### 15. Ledger integrity (must be an empty list)
GET {{api}}/ops/ledger-integrity
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
